<title>USA: A.M. Best upgrades Farm Family unit to A.</title>
<headline>A.M. Best upgrades Farm Family unit to A.</headline>
<dateline>GLENMONT, N.Y. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Farm Family Holdings Inc said Wednesday that A.M. Best has upgraded the rating of its subsidiary, Farm Family Casualty Insurance Co, to A, from A-.</p>
<p>Farm Family said the upgrade reflects improved capitalization, profitable operating performance and favorable loss reserve development.</p>
<p>Farm Family is a specialized property and casualty insurer of farms, and the residents and businesses of rural and suburban communities.</p>
</text>
